# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 (a forwarded child place is re-emitted at 0/[p]/0, its row built in the tick the place is born) and ch. 7 (round 3 ST: the document after n is published at n+1): each row's label shows its own key.
test the_rows_label_reads_its_own_key

